    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Bunker 9</strong>, you and your friends must fight to survive in a zombie-infested world. Upgrade and enhance your <strong>bunker</strong>, enhance your <strong>gear</strong>, and <strong>battle</strong> relentless hordes of the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Defend</strong> \u2013 Strengthen your bunker with powerful upgrades, turning it into the ultimate survival fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight for Survival</strong> \u2013 Use weapons, character enhancements, and teamwork to take on ever-growing zombie threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Scavenge</strong> \u2013 Search the world for food, water, and resources to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Survival</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends to strategize, survive, and thrive together.</p>",
